invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: a ticket names the key in pin slot A whichever slot authenticated
  the handshake. A ticket from a handshake that the key in slot B
  authenticated is then refused once step 3 of a rotation moves that key
  to slot A.

--- old
    int second = t->pin_slot == 2;
--- new
    int second = 0;
    (void)t->pin_slot;
